## 3. Target stack (what the preset actually installs)

Verified from the generated `package.json`:

| Package | Version | Note |
|---|---|---|
| `next` | 16.2.6 | Turbopack default |
| `react` / `react-dom` | 19.2.4 | |
| `tailwindcss` | ^4 | via `@tailwindcss/postcss` |
| `@base-ui/react` | ^1.6.0 | **replaces all Radix packages** |
| `@hugeicons/react` + `@hugeicons/core-free-icons` | ^1.1.9 / ^4.2.3 | |
| `shadcn` | ^4.16.0 | runtime dep — `@import "shadcn/tailwind.css"` |
| `next-themes` | ^0.4.6 | |
| `tw-animate-css` | ^1.4.0 | replaces `tailwindcss-animate` |
| `class-variance-authority`, `clsx`, `tailwind-merge` ^3.6 | | `cn()` unchanged |

Also generated: `prettier` + `prettier-plugin-tailwindcss`, `eslint-config-next`,
`.prettierrc`, scripts `dev/build/start/lint/format/typecheck`.

**`components.json` the preset writes:**

```json
{ "style": "base-luma", "rsc": true, "tsx": true,
  "tailwind": { "config": "", "css": "app/globals.css",
                "baseColor": "neutral", "cssVariables": true },
  "iconLibrary": "hugeicons", "rtl": false,
  "menuColor": "default", "menuAccent": "bold", "registries": {} }
```

Note `"config": ""` — **Tailwind v4 has no config file.** `tailwind.config.ts`,
`postcss.config.js`, and the v3 `@tailwind` directives are all deleted.

### AGENTS.md warning (ships with the scaffold)

> *"This is NOT the Next.js you know. This version has breaking changes — APIs,
> conventions, and file structure may all differ from your training data. Read the
> relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before writing any code."*

Docs are bundled at `node_modules/next/dist/docs/{01-app,02-pages,03-architecture}`.
**Consult them before writing App Router code** rather than relying on recall.

