## 9. Phased execution

### Phase 0 — Safety
- [ ] `git checkout -b migrate/nextjs`
- [ ] Confirm clean tree. Tag the pre-migration commit.
- [ ] Screenshot all 4 screens at desktop + mobile widths for later comparison.

### Phase 1 — Scaffold & merge
- [ ] Run the `--name .next-scaffold` command from §2.
- [ ] `rsync -a --exclude .git .next-scaffold/ .` then `rm -rf .next-scaffold`.
- [ ] Delete Vite-era files: `vite.config.ts`, `index.html`, `postcss.config.js`,
      `tailwind.config.ts`, `tsconfig.app.json`, `tsconfig.node.json`,
      `eslint.config.js`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/App.css`,
      `src/index.css`, `src/vite-env.d.ts`, `package-lock.json`, `bun.lockb`.
- [ ] Merge `public/` (keep `favicon.ico`, `robots.txt`; drop `placeholder.svg` if unused).
- [ ] `bun run build` on the bare scaffold — **must pass before touching app code.**
      (Verified passing: `✓ Compiled successfully in 1875ms`.)

### Phase 2 — UI primitives
- [ ] `bunx --bun shadcn@latest add button input textarea card sidebar sonner tooltip label`
      (all confirmed present in `base-luma`).
- [ ] **Delete all 49 files in `src/components/ui/`** and `src/hooks/use-toast.ts`.
- [ ] Keep `src/hooks/use-mobile.tsx` only if the registry's `use-mobile` doesn't land it.
- [ ] Move `src/lib/utils.ts` → scaffold's `lib/utils.ts` (identical `cn`, no change).

### Phase 3 — Move app code
- [ ] `src/pages/*` → `app/**/page.tsx` per §7, add `"use client"`.
- [ ] `src/components/*.tsx` → `components/*.tsx`, add `"use client"`.
- [ ] `src/utils/pdfExport.ts` → `lib/pdfExport.ts`. It touches `window` — must
      only be called from a client component (it already is, via a click handler).
- [ ] Rewrite router imports → `next/link`, `next/navigation`.
- [ ] Strip `QueryClientProvider` + drop `@tanstack/react-query`.

### Phase 4 — Icons (§6)
- [ ] Rewrite 30 icon call sites to `HugeiconsIcon`.
- [ ] Remove `lucide-react`.
- [ ] Visual pass for glyph mismatches.

### Phase 5 — Theme (§4, §5)
- [ ] Replace 140 hardcoded color classes with semantic tokens.
- [ ] Fix the 10 bare `border` occurrences → `border-border`.
- [ ] Convert `space-x-*`/`space-y-*` → `gap-*` inside flex containers.
- [ ] `bg-gradient-to-*` → `bg-linear-to-*` for any survivors.
- [ ] **Test both light and dark** — dark is on by default.

### Phase 6 — Cleanup
- [ ] Purge Lovable: `lovable-tagger` dep, OG/twitter meta → real Next `metadata`.
- [ ] `README.md` rewrite.
- [ ] Merge scaffold `AGENTS.md` with any project conventions.
- [ ] Ensure `.gitignore` covers `.next/`.

