## 10. Verification checklist

- [ ] `bun run build` clean
- [ ] `bun run typecheck` clean — note `strict: false` today vs the scaffold's
      `strict: true`. Expect new errors (`strictNullChecks` especially, given
      `canvas?: Canvas` optional props flow into non-optional reads). Decide:
      loosen `tsconfig.json` to match the old settings, or fix properly.
- [ ] `bun run lint` clean
- [ ] All 4 routes render; deep links work (hard refresh on `/profile`)
- [ ] 404 renders on an unknown path
- [ ] Sidebar navigation + collapse works
- [ ] Create-canvas modal → new card appears
- [ ] Canvas editor: add text section → save → appears in "Saved Sections"
- [ ] Image upload + drag/drop
- [ ] Export PDF opens print dialog
- [ ] Share modal: copy link (`navigator.clipboard` needs HTTPS/localhost)
- [ ] Customer view: post a comment
- [ ] **Light and dark both legible**
- [ ] Mobile widths — sidebar sheet behavior

