## 11. Risks

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Radix → Base UI API drift in `sidebar` (the most complex primitive) | **High** | Take the registry's `sidebar.tsx` verbatim; adapt `AppSidebar` to it, never the reverse |
| `strict: true` surfaces latent null-safety bugs | Med | Budget time; or match old tsconfig looseness initially and tighten later |
| `space-x-*` v4 selector change silently shifts 45 spots | Med | Convert to `gap-*` rather than trusting compat |
| Bare `border` renders `currentColor` | Med | Explicit `border-border` on all 10 |
| Hugeicons glyphs differ despite matching names | Low | Visual pass |
| Next 16 APIs differ from training data | Med | **Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` per AGENTS.md** |
| Merge step clobbers `.git` | **High** | `rsync --exclude .git`; verify `git log` after |

